Repository History:
This repository was originally MindNLP (2019-2024), a MindSpore-based NLP
library developed at Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. The legacy codebase is
preserved in the 'legacy' branch.

Original MindNLP copyright notice:
  MindNLP
  Copyright 2019-2020 Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd
  Licensed under Apache License 2.0

The MindNLP project contained code from:
- transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers), Apache 2.0
- diffusers (https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers), Apache 2.0

---

MindAct (2026-present) is a complete rewrite and does not contain code from
the original MindNLP codebase. MindAct integrates with:

- PyTorch (https://pytorch.org/), BSD 3-Clause
- LeRobot (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot), Apache 2.0
- LIBERO (https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO), MIT License

Users of MindAct should consult the licenses of these dependencies.
